Subject: [PATCH] Preserve F# test tracing with the maintained OTLP exporter

The deprecated Jaeger exporter has no fixed release for GHSA-38h3-2333-qx47.
Migrate only FSharp.Test.Utilities' trace exporter from Jaeger 1.4.0 to OTLP
1.15.3, the first coherent family fixing the recorded OTLP/API advisories.
Keep every original test/project, compiler activity source, resource/service,
span/tag, ForceFlush and disposal path. The maintained exporter also honors
OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_* environment variables for an OTLP-capable collector.

The API 1.15.3 package requires DiagnosticSource 10.0.0 on net9.0. Pin that
dependency in this test project only; do not change F# product dependencies
or let its existing explicit 8.0.0 reference produce a NuGet downgrade.
NuGet auditing and warnings remain enabled. Retain actual restored inputs,
all 17 introduced package identities, complete exact corresponding sources,
publisher VMR/component mapping and original licenses/notices.

Native ARM validation: audited all-transitive restore with warnings as errors;
F# compilation of the exact tracer builder; real loopback HTTP/Protobuf export
of the compiler span, service and tags; original ForceFlush/Dispose lifecycle.
Original complete VMR build/test and both-CPU qualification remain mandatory.

Advisory: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet/security/advisories/GHSA-38h3-2333-qx47
Advisory: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet/security/advisories/GHSA-g94r-2vxg-569j
Advisory: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet/security/advisories/GHSA-4625-4j76-fww9
Advisory: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet/security/advisories/GHSA-mr8r-92fq-pj8p
Advisory: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet/security/advisories/GHSA-q834-8qmm-v933
Publisher-Source: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet/tree/d622e6c7c899527638b53a6b06919859f5752add
Base-VMR: 9f04b57d1366e21b3178648493d6edffeff2216e

diff --git a/src/fsharp/tests/FSharp.Test.Utilities/FSharp.Test.Utilities.fsproj b/src/fsharp/tests/FSharp.Test.Utilities/FSharp.Test.Utilities.fsproj
--- a/src/fsharp/tests/FSharp.Test.Utilities/FSharp.Test.Utilities.fsproj
+++ b/src/fsharp/tests/FSharp.Test.Utilities/FSharp.Test.Utilities.fsproj
@@ -89,7 +89,7 @@
     <PackageReference Include="System.Collections.Immutable" Version="$(SystemCollectionsImmutableVersion)" GeneratePathProperty="true" />
     <PackageReference Include="System.Memory" Version="$(SystemMemoryVersion)" />
     <PackageReference Include="System.Buffers" Version="$(SystemBuffersVersion)" />
-    <PackageReference Include="System.Diagnostics.DiagnosticSource" Version="$(SystemDiagnosticsDiagnosticSourceVersion)" />
+    <PackageReference Include="System.Diagnostics.DiagnosticSource" Version="10.0.0" />
     <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.DiaSymReader.PortablePdb" Version="$(MicrosoftDiaSymReaderPortablePdbVersion)">
       <PrivateAssets>all</PrivateAssets>
       <IncludeAssets>runtime; build; native; contentfiles; analyzers; buildtransitive</IncludeAssets>
@@ -99,7 +99,7 @@
     <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp" Version="$(MicrosoftCodeAnalysisCSharpVersion)" />
     <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.Test.Resources.Proprietary" Version="$(MicrosoftCodeAnalysisTestResourcesProprietaryVersion)" />
     <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.NETCore.App.Ref" Version="6.0.0" IncludeAssets="none" PrivateAssets="all" GeneratePathProperty="true" />
-    <PackageReference Include="OpenTelemetry.Exporter.Jaeger" Version="1.4.0" />
+    <PackageReference Include="OpenTelemetry.Exporter.OpenTelemetryProtocol" Version="1.15.3" />
 	<PackageReference Include="Newtonsoft.Json" Version="$(NewtonsoftJsonVersion)" />
   </ItemGroup>
 
diff --git a/src/fsharp/tests/FSharp.Test.Utilities/ProjectGeneration.fs b/src/fsharp/tests/FSharp.Test.Utilities/ProjectGeneration.fs
--- a/src/fsharp/tests/FSharp.Test.Utilities/ProjectGeneration.fs
+++ b/src/fsharp/tests/FSharp.Test.Utilities/ProjectGeneration.fs
@@ -1014,7 +1014,7 @@
             Sdk.CreateTracerProviderBuilder()
                 .AddSource("fsc")
                 .SetResourceBuilder(ResourceBuilder.CreateDefault().AddService(serviceName="F#", serviceVersion = "1"))
-                .AddJaegerExporter()
+                .AddOtlpExporter()
                 .Build()
             |> Some
         activity <- Activity.start ctx.Project.Name [ Activity.Tags.project, ctx.Project.Name; "UsingTransparentCompiler", useTransparentCompiler.ToString() ] |> Some
